OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mainly dry and bright start
OL,6,Fwith light winds and just the odd
OL,7,Fshower. Rain will soon reach the
OL,8,FHebrides before spreading northeast to
OL,9,Fall parts, turning heavy a times.
OL,10,FStrengthening southeasterly winds with
OL,11,Fgales later over the Hebrides.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThere will be further
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain, heavy at times and
OL,15,Faccompanied by gusty winds. Severe
OL,16,Fgales over the Hebrides later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
