OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FIt will be another very
OL,6,Funsettled day with further spells of
OL,7,Fheavy rain. Southwesterly winds will
OL,8,Fbe very strong with severe gales for a
OL,9,Ftime.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,12,Fmuch quieter end to the week with some
OL,13,Fshowers at times but also dry and
OL,14,Fbright weather. Still rather breezy,
OL,15,Fespecially in the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
